# Retched Wretch: "if it had a -1/-1 counter on it" (CR 603.4, 603.10a) is true with exactly one. Bot2 Lightning Bolts Bot1's
# Bile-Vial Boggart, whose dying ability puts a -1/-1 counter on the Wretch (a 3/1); a second Bolt kills the Wretch, and it
# returns, untapped, as a new 4/2 with no counter. The three Moxen pay the Wretch, a Swamp the Boggart, and Bot2's two Mox Rubies
# the Bolts.

